{"repositoryId":1415897145,"availability":"available","full":"alfiochoa/price-stock-monitor","name":"price-stock-monitor","description":"Config-driven competitor price & stock monitor: resilient scraper (requests/BS4/Playwright), SQLite change detection, webhook alerts, breakage detector, Streamlit dashboard. Sandbox sites only.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-12T17:04:28Z","updated":"2026-10-13T18:41:58Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://alfredo-price-stock-monitor.streamlit.app/","topics":["beautifulsoup","data-extraction","github-actions","playwright","portfolio","price-monitoring","python","sqlite","streamlit","web-scraping"],"demo":"https://alfredo-price-stock-monitor.streamlit.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:45.454Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:45.454Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:45.454Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T02:47:45.454Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A small online store wants to know when competitors change prices or run out of stock. This pipeline scrapes competitor catalogues on a schedule, keeps a price/availability history in SQLite, detects changes (price drop/rise %, back in stock / out of stock), pings a Slack/Discord webhook, exports CSV/XLSX, and shows it all in a Streamlit dashboard. New sites are added with a YAML file — no code.","Built and demoed only against scraping sandboxes (books.toscrape.com, webscraper.io/test-sites) and a local mock store whose prices change over simulated days. See Ethics."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alfiochoa/price-stock-monitor/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8b990963b3e049e09577bc71cf4ba5e2cec639517f8257a6bfa9ad6ab195ffe4","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:45.525Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:45.525Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A small online store wants to know when comp